## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Code Restructuring
* Move root dashboard files (`index.html`, `styles.css`, `app.js`) to `c:/Users/admin.DESKTOP-17T37DJ/Desktop/aic/main_dashboard/`.

### Component 2: Pipeline Engine API (`pipeline_engine`)
A second FastAPI service running on port `8001`. It will manage execution states for running machine learning pipeline DAGs.

#### [NEW] [pipeline_engine/requirements.txt](file:///c:/Users/admin.DESKTOP-17T37DJ/Desktop/aic/pipeline_engine/requirements.txt)
* FastAPI, Uvicorn, CORS middleware.

#### [NEW] [pipeline_engine/orchestrator.py](file:///c:/Users/admin.DESKTOP-17T37DJ/Desktop/aic/pipeline_engine/orchestrator.py)
* Threaded/async runner for executing pipeline steps.
* Defines steps according to `algorithm_family` in the input profile:
  * **Regression DAG**: Data Preprocessing $\rightarrow$ Feature Selection $\rightarrow$ Hyperparameter Grid Search $\rightarrow$ Model Evaluation $\rightarrow$ Model Deployment.
  * **Anomaly Detection DAG**: Normalization $\rightarrow$ Dimensionality Reduction (PCA) $\rightarrow$ Isolation Forest Contamination Fitting $\rightarrow$ Evaluation $\rightarrow$ Model Deployment.
  * **Miscellaneous DAG**: Category Labeling $\rightarrow$ Random Forest Fitting $\rightarrow$ Accuracy Evaluation $\rightarrow$ Model Deployment.
* Emits live step logs and outputs (e.g. training scores, coefficients, simulated endpoint URL).

#### [NEW] [pipeline_engine/main.py](file:///c:/Users/admin.DESKTOP-17T37DJ/Desktop/aic/pipeline_engine/main.py)
* FastAPI routing.
* `POST /api/v1/pipeline/run`: Starts a background thread running the orchestrator DAG.
* `GET /api/v1/pipeline/{dag_id}/status`: Returns live logs, progress percentage, step statuses, and results if completed.

